OL,3,GNEWSA'Long way to go' for South Asian
OL,4,Afootballers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a "long way to go" in
OL,7,Fimproving South Asian representation in
OL,8,Ffootball, a player has said.
OL,10,FWolverhampton-born Kam Kandola, who
OL,11,Fplays for Hereford FC, said he hoped to
OL,12,Fsee more players of a similar
OL,13,Fbackground to him getting involved in
OL,14,Fgrassroots football at a younger age.
OL,16,F"Football wise, we're a minority in how
OL,17,Fmany you're seeing," he said. "You can
OL,18,Fstill probably count [South Asian
OL,19,Fplayers] on one [or] two hands
OL,20,Funfortunately."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
